### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@memberToken = REPLACE_WITH_MEMBER_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Get current member profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Upload avatar
# In IntelliJ HTTP Client, replace the file path with an existing image on your machine.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/members/me/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FitLifeBoundary
Accept: application/json

--FitLifeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--FitLifeBoundary--
